<title>EGYPT: Egypt o/n, weekly rates widen.</title>
<headline>Egypt o/n, weekly rates widen.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound ranged from seven to 8-1/2 percent in a liquid private sector market on Tuesday compared to Monday's 7 percent, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rates widened to seven and 8-3/4 percent from eight and 8-1/4 percent, they added.</p>
<p>Bankers said that public sector banks had kept their minimum lending rate steady at 10-1/2 percent.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
